\nL26: \nL27: Answer\nL28: ## Why can't I download the Audible Android app on Windows 11?\nL29: \nL30: Microsoft discontinued the Amazon Appstore on Windows 11 in March 2024. The Audible Android app is no longer available or supported on Windows 11.\nL31: \nL32: To keep listening to titles in your library, you can use the Audible mobile app for iOS or Android, sign in to 【1†Audible.com†audible.com】 to listen with the 【2†Cloud Player†help.audible.in】, or listen on your Alexa/Echo devices. Learn more about 【3†how you can listen†www.audible.com】 to Audible.\nL33: If you want to transfer your titles onto a supported MP3 player, you can do so 【4†using AudibleSync】.\nL34: \nL35: Did this answer your question?\nL36: \nL37: 【5†Image: Thumbs Up】Like\nL38: \nL39: \nL40: \nL41: 【6†Image: Thumbs Down】Dislike\nL42: \nL43:  Back to top\nL44: \nL45: 【7†Image: Share link】 Share link\nL46: \nL47: 【8†Image: Download PDF】 Download PDF\nL48: ## Need more assistance?\nL49: \nL50: 【9†Contact us†www.audible.com】\nL51: \nL52: \nL53: \nL54: How satisfied were you with our Help Center today?\nL55: \nL56: \nL57: \nL58: Worst\nL59: \nL60: 1\nL61: \nL62: 2\nL63: \nL64: 3\nL65: \nL66: 4\nL67: \nL68: 5\nL69: \nL70: 6\nL71: \nL72: 7\nL73: \nL74: Best\nL75: \nL76: \nL77: \nL78: Region\nL79: \nL80: United States\nL81: \nL82: Language\nL83: \nL84: English\nL85: \nL86: Loading\nL87: \nL88: Audible App Download Discontinued on Windows 11 【10†Adobe ID Syncing iFrame†audible.demdex.net】\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nShare a title (https://help.audible.com/s/article/share-a-title)\nciteturn1003view3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; Content type: text/html; Source: click({\"ref_id\":\"turn998view0\",\"id\":23}); Total lines: 130\nL0: Loading\nL1: \nL2: Sorry to interrupt\nL3: \nL4: Uncaught TypeError: Cannot read properties of null (reading 'style')\nL5: \nL6: 【0†Refresh】\nL7: \nL8: Skip to Main Content\nL9: \nL10: Related topics\nL11: \nL12: Android Ask A Question iOS Listening Player+1\nL13: ## Share a title\nL14: \nL15:   * Sep 3, 2026\nL16:   * Knowledge\nL17: \nL18: Title\nL19: \nL20: Share a title\nL21: \nL22: URL Name\nL23: \nL24: share-a-title\nL25: \nL26: Answer\nL27: \nL28: You can share audiobooks as recommendations with friends and family directly from your Audible app or website. When you share a title, you're sending the book's details. Recipients can then decide if they'd like to buy the audiobook or not. You can share any title, whether it's in your Library or not.\nL29: \nL30: Note:\nL31:   * You can also set up 【1†Amazon Family†www.amazon.com】 or a 【2†Kids Profile】 to let family members listen to your audiobooks.\nL32:   * The \"Send this book\" feature is no longer available. You can still share title recommendations using the steps below.\nL33: \nL34: In this article:\nL35: \nL36:   * 【3†How do I share a title recommendation in my Library?】\nL37:   * 【4†How do I share a title recommendation that is not in my Library?】\nL38: ## How do I share a title recommendation in my Library?\nL39: \nL40: In the app\nL41: \nL42: Using the 3-dot More menu\nL43: \nL44:   1. Open the Audible app.\nL45:   2. Go to your Library.\nL46:   3. Find the title you want to share.\nL47:   4. Select the 3-dot More menu.\nL48:   5. Select Share.\nL49: \nL50: Using select and hold\nL51: \nL52:   1. Open the Audible app.\nL53:   2. Go to your Library.\nL54:   3. Find the title you want to share.\nL55:   4. Select and hold the title.\nL56:   5. Select Share.\nL57: \nL58: On the Audible website\nL59:   1. Go to your Library.\nL60:   2. Select the title's 3-dot More menu.\nL61:   3. Select Share.\nL62: ## How do I share a title recommendation that is not in my Library?\nL63: \nL64: In the app\nL65: \nL66:   1. Open the Audible app.\nL67:   2. Search for the book you want to share.\nL68:   3. Select the title to access the detail page.\nL69:   4. Select the Share icon.\nL70:   5. Select the app in which you want to share the audiobook. If you don't see your favorite app, select More Options.\nL71: \nL72: On the Audible website\nL73: \nL74:   1. Go to the detail page of the title you want to share.\nL75:   2. Select the Share icon.\nL76: \nL77: Did this answer your question?\nL78: 【5†Image: Thumbs Up】Like\nL79: \nL80: \nL81: \nL82: 【6†Image: Thumbs Down】Dislike\nL83: \nL84:  Back to top\nL85: \nL86: 【7†Image: Share link】 Share link\nL87: \nL88: 【8†Image: Download PDF】 Download PDF\nL89: ## Need more assistance?\nL90: \nL91: 【9†Contact us†www.audible.com】\nL92: \nL93: \nL94: \nL95: How satisfied were you with our Help Center today?\nL96: \nL97: \nL98: \nL99: Worst\nL100: \nL101: 1\nL102: \nL103: 2\nL104: \nL105: 3\nL106: \nL107: 4\nL108: \nL109: 5\nL110: \nL111: 6\nL112: \nL113: 7\nL114: \nL115: Best\nL116: \nL117: \nL118: \nL119: Region\nL120: \nL121: United States\nL122: \nL123: Language\nL124: \nL125: English\nL126: \nL127: Loading\nL128: \nL129: Share a title 【10†Adobe ID Syncing iFrame†audible.demdex.net】\n"
